@cc [owner:ghuntley,label:verification] shared-fixtures-preserve-boundaries
Shared fixtures MUST retain the consuming suites' TLS, authentication, explicit
migration, resource and failure checks. Moving setup into support MUST NOT make
guest execution optional or silently broaden trusted networks.

@cc [owner:ghuntley,label:verification] composed-drivers-statically-checked
Python driver fragments MUST be composed in an explicit order during Nix
evaluation. The complete driver MUST pass the NixOS framework's lint and type
checks; runtime exec or disabling checks MUST NOT hide fragments from validation.

@cc [owner:ghuntley,label:verification] native-serial-evidence-channel
Native Firecracker fixtures reading structured guest serial events MUST select
an explicit owned VMM log path and capture startup stderr separately from serial
stdout. The default VMM logger shares stdout with the guest. A host diagnostic
interleaved with a guest record MUST NOT become guest evidence or be silently
repaired into one.
